<div class="wp-block-group sb-legal__body"><!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"what","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="what"><span>01</span> What cookies are</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Cookies are small text files that a website stores in your browser. They let the site remember things between pages, such as what is in your cart or that you are logged in.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"essential","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="essential"><span>02</span> Cookies we use</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These are strictly necessary for the shop and your account to work, so they do not need consent:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:table {"className":"sb-table"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-table sb-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><thead><tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>woocommerce_cart_hash</td><td>Remembers changes to your cart</td><td>Session</td></tr><tr><td>woocommerce_items_in_cart</td><td>Tells the site your cart has items</td><td>Session</td></tr><tr><td>wp_woocommerce_session_*</td><td>Keeps your cart and checkout details</td><td>Up to 2 days</td></tr><tr><td>wordpress_logged_in_*</td><td>Keeps you logged in to your account</td><td>Session or 14 days if you choose "remember me"</td></tr><tr><td>wordpress_sec_*</td><td>Secures your login</td><td>Session or 14 days</td></tr><tr><td>wordpress_test_cookie</td><td>Checks that your browser accepts cookies</td><td>Session</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
<!-- /wp:table -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"analytics","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="analytics"><span>03</span> Analytics and advertising</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not currently use analytics, advertising or social media tracking cookies. If we add them, we will show a consent banner first, they will stay off until you accept, and this page will be updated.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"control","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="control"><span>04</span> How to control cookies</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You can view and delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking the cookies listed above will stop the cart, checkout and account from working.</p>
